The Citizens Committee for Metaphysical Stability is less an org than a loose association. It was formed by spellcasters, alchemists and soothsayers who were being pushed out of their trades by larger orgs, so that together they would have some bargaining power. It is less corporate than its rivals and less structured; what any one member can offer varies. Members take work for a fee, and there are people of the Committee in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]] and [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Deosil|Deosil]]. [[People/Sharp the Cunning Man|Sharp the Cunning Man]] is a member listed in a local directory.
